WEBVTT

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:21.200
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.970
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:32.740
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:37.680
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:43.520
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:50.200
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:55.900
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:01.070
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:06.880
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:13.390
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:19.060
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:24.200
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:27.960
Shine the light!

00:01:34.314 --> 00:01:36.654
What is this place?

00:01:36.654 --> 00:01:39.424
You wanted to talk to me in person.

00:01:39.424 --> 00:01:44.584
It'll be a problem for both of us if
I'm seen near the head temple, right?

00:01:49.124 --> 00:01:52.464
There's a Shikabane Hime
that I want you to evaluate.

00:01:52.464 --> 00:01:55.304
You're concerned about a Shikabane Hime?

00:01:55.304 --> 00:01:57.634
It's about the daughter of Hoshimura.

00:02:00.474 --> 00:02:03.114
Keisei Tagami's Shikabane Hime...

00:02:03.114 --> 00:02:06.144
I heard that she's ill.

00:02:06.144 --> 00:02:09.984
Those in the Shuhou faction, such as
Takamine, are against getting rid of her.

00:02:09.984 --> 00:02:13.484
So you want us to secretly kill her?

00:02:13.484 --> 00:02:18.824
After evaluating her, if you see
no chance of rehabilitation or virtue...

00:02:34.804 --> 00:02:41.614
You know that he loves you
guys more than anyone, right?

00:02:41.614 --> 00:02:44.484
So much he wants to kill us...

00:02:49.794 --> 00:02:51.154
Please wait!

00:02:51.154 --> 00:02:52.664
Why are you stopping us?

00:02:52.664 --> 00:02:55.564
Akasha, you're the one who wished...

00:02:55.564 --> 00:02:59.164
that we, the Seven Stars,
make the Kougon Sect our enemy.

00:02:59.164 --> 00:03:03.174
For that purpose, we've spent the
last six months killing contracted monks.

00:03:03.174 --> 00:03:06.674
And yet, why are you
suddenly attacking the head temple?

00:03:06.674 --> 00:03:10.644
Out of our way.
We have to hurry or our toys will die.

00:03:10.644 --> 00:03:14.414
We're just going to check
out that Shikabane Hime.

00:03:14.414 --> 00:03:16.154
Check out you said?!

00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:18.584
You mean Keisei Tagami's Shikabane Hime?

00:03:21.854 --> 00:03:23.394
Have you forgotten?

00:03:23.394 --> 00:03:27.584
We are the ones who made the
Shikabane Hime named Makina Hoshimura.

00:03:29.434 --> 00:03:34.504
I sensed that her life is about to end.

00:03:34.504 --> 00:03:37.604
It wouldn't be fun if she dies like that.

00:03:37.604 --> 00:03:43.544
Are you saying that Makina Hoshimura
is a special Shikabane Hime to you?

00:03:43.544 --> 00:03:46.344
That's what I wanna check.

00:03:55.084 --> 00:03:56.794
Hokuto-sama...

00:03:56.794 --> 00:04:01.464
You're... always producing that water.

00:04:01.464 --> 00:04:02.454
What?

00:04:04.064 --> 00:04:06.124
Water...

00:04:09.474 --> 00:04:11.734
Hokuto-sama, please stop.

00:04:13.144 --> 00:04:15.804
Ah... A bug...

00:04:22.584 --> 00:04:24.154
Hizuchi-san...

00:04:24.154 --> 00:04:28.154
To Hokuto, everything
in this world is abnormal.

00:04:28.154 --> 00:04:31.794
Her life was put to an
end before she ever sinned.

00:04:31.794 --> 00:04:34.464
She was born to die.

00:04:34.464 --> 00:04:39.604
So to her, everything that touches
her is like a blade that can hurt her.

00:04:39.604 --> 00:04:42.004
Then she never held hands with anyone?

00:04:42.004 --> 00:04:43.494
A bug...

00:04:48.144 --> 00:04:52.274
Uncontrollable power that goes beyond
the bond with her contracted monk...

00:04:52.274 --> 00:04:54.684
A Shikabane Hime who is
possessed by that curse

00:04:54.684 --> 00:04:58.654
needs to be purified before
she turns into a Shikabane.

00:04:58.654 --> 00:05:02.324
Normally, it shouldn't take
even a month, though...

00:05:02.324 --> 00:05:08.294
Since it's taking six months, Gon-Dai-Sojo
is talking about getting rid of her.

00:05:08.294 --> 00:05:12.124
However, I'd rather her
not die if we can avoid it.

00:05:14.704 --> 00:05:18.304
It's strange that she can't get out of
the purification chamber for six months!

00:05:18.304 --> 00:05:22.604
But it's still the case that the Shikabane
Hime's curse hasn't been removed yet!

00:05:22.604 --> 00:05:27.014
I'm a doctor. I can examine her.

00:05:27.014 --> 00:05:30.684
A Gon-Sojo should not enter a place like this.

00:05:30.684 --> 00:05:31.514
Who are you?!

00:05:31.514 --> 00:05:34.154
My name is Kurai. I'm an Inspector.

00:05:34.154 --> 00:05:39.114
His Grace Gon-Dai-Sojo put me
in charge of Makina Hoshimura's case.

00:05:41.994 --> 00:05:43.054
Saki!

00:05:46.834 --> 00:05:48.364
What're you doing?!

00:05:48.364 --> 00:05:51.334
It's written clearly on your forehead that...

00:05:51.334 --> 00:05:53.344
if you get involved with
Shikabane Hime, the defiled ones,

00:05:53.344 --> 00:05:56.504
your Enlightenment gets
that much further away.

00:06:00.744 --> 00:06:04.884
Say, what's heaven like?

00:06:04.884 --> 00:06:06.224
Hm?

00:06:06.224 --> 00:06:08.524
I'm not really that interested,

00:06:08.524 --> 00:06:12.694
but the other Shikabane Hime are
fighting in order to go to heaven, right?

00:06:12.694 --> 00:06:15.194
Yeah, seems like it.

00:06:15.194 --> 00:06:19.164
Well, the heaven or paradise that we refer to

00:06:19.164 --> 00:06:22.234
is becoming unified with Buddha's
spirit by attaining Enlightenment

00:06:22.234 --> 00:06:25.674
and arriving at a world
with no grief or worry.

00:06:25.674 --> 00:06:30.514
To achieve that, monks perform many
virtuous deeds and you guys have to...

00:06:30.514 --> 00:06:36.454
A Shikabane Hime can't attain Enlightenment
until she destroys 108 Shikabane.

00:06:36.454 --> 00:06:43.294
But... if no grief or worry means that
one doesn't even remember or worry

00:06:43.294 --> 00:06:48.464
about his family or friends he left behind
in this world, it's a little sad, isn't it...

00:06:48.464 --> 00:06:50.454
Yeah...

00:06:59.404 --> 00:07:01.374
Rika-san?

00:07:06.784 --> 00:07:08.474
Rika, look down there!

00:07:12.984 --> 00:07:16.494
To think that Shiryou gained
entrance to the head temple!

00:07:16.494 --> 00:07:21.894
Shiryou are the form taken by those who
couldn't even become Shikabane, right?

00:07:28.464 --> 00:07:32.434
They're eating... whatever it is that
is coming out from Makina's body!

00:07:32.434 --> 00:07:34.804
In any case, we have to do
something about these Shiryou.

00:07:34.804 --> 00:07:35.794
Yeah.

00:07:38.274 --> 00:07:40.084
This black ink...

00:07:40.084 --> 00:07:44.684
They say that it weakens our power...
Damn, it's hard to fight!

00:07:44.684 --> 00:07:46.444
You bastard! You bastard!

00:07:49.654 --> 00:07:52.314
Shiryou are trying to take on physical form?

00:07:54.994 --> 00:07:56.014
Saki!

00:08:04.134 --> 00:08:05.364
Kamika...

00:08:12.714 --> 00:08:18.554
Those Shiryou are devouring the Rune
that's leaking from Makina Hoshimura's body.

00:08:18.554 --> 00:08:22.954
Rune is just like the blood that
circulates in our body, right?

00:08:22.954 --> 00:08:27.564
It's giving power to the Shiryou...
I've never heard of such a thing.

00:08:27.564 --> 00:08:33.464
Rune is life energy, which is purity itself,
provided by a contracted monk.

00:08:33.464 --> 00:08:38.174
But no matter how pure something is,
it begins to rot if it stagnates.

00:08:38.174 --> 00:08:42.904
If you store up old Rune,
it rots and invites Shiryou.

00:08:42.904 --> 00:08:48.544
What's inside Makina-chan
is Senior Tagami's Rune...

00:08:48.544 --> 00:08:52.054
Makina's regrets towards
Keisei Tagami were so strong

00:08:52.054 --> 00:08:56.354
that she unconsciously stored up
the Rune given by him and let it rot.

00:08:56.354 --> 00:09:02.394
But she's got a new contracted monk.
If she receives Ouri-kun's Rune...

00:09:02.394 --> 00:09:06.164
But he hasn't even
gone through proper training.

00:09:06.164 --> 00:09:09.064
More importantly, no matter
who the contracted monk is,

00:09:09.064 --> 00:09:12.774
if she doesn't want to accept
his Rune, it'll be the same.

00:09:12.774 --> 00:09:14.944
What should we do?

00:09:14.944 --> 00:09:19.574
If this continues, her own Rune will
be eaten up and she'll be destroyed.

00:09:20.014 --> 00:09:23.214
I see... This is serious!

00:09:24.454 --> 00:09:25.444
Who's there?!

00:09:28.754 --> 00:09:29.894
Your Grace...

00:09:29.894 --> 00:09:33.624
Don't bother. It's not our enemy.

00:09:35.864 --> 00:09:37.764
That darn Umehara...

00:09:43.474 --> 00:09:49.604
Oh my god! I dropped my specially-made
master detective coat and hat.

00:09:49.604 --> 00:09:52.944
I can't live as a detective like this!

00:10:04.324 --> 00:10:06.294
So he still isn't back yet?

00:10:06.294 --> 00:10:07.454
What?

00:10:08.494 --> 00:10:12.484
No... It's been six months, hasn't it...

00:10:19.804 --> 00:10:20.474
What's this?

00:10:20.474 --> 00:10:21.634
That's...

00:10:24.914 --> 00:10:26.984
Looks good.

00:10:26.984 --> 00:10:31.004
If you sell this to Ushijima,
you can make good money.

00:10:33.124 --> 00:10:34.624
Just kidding.

00:10:34.624 --> 00:10:39.294
But I didn't realize you
were so serious about Ouri.

00:10:39.294 --> 00:10:42.524
I know him a little. That's all.

00:10:42.524 --> 00:10:45.034
But the last I heard was that
he suddenly went on a trip

00:10:45.034 --> 00:10:48.434
after his brother passed away, so...

00:10:48.434 --> 00:10:50.974
Seriously, that idiot!

00:10:50.974 --> 00:10:54.644
When he could do as he pleases with
such nice breasts if he were here now.

00:10:54.644 --> 00:10:58.274
What? As he pleases? What would he do?

00:10:58.274 --> 00:11:00.484
Oh? You don't know?

00:11:00.484 --> 00:11:05.784
Ouri may look innocent, but he
likes to do this and that to big breasts.

00:11:12.524 --> 00:11:14.114
No!

00:11:17.894 --> 00:11:20.404
You don't have to dislike me that much.

00:11:20.404 --> 00:11:23.024
Hey, just come over here.

00:11:25.634 --> 00:11:27.004
How's it going?

00:11:27.004 --> 00:11:28.044
What?

00:11:28.044 --> 00:11:30.744
Oh boy, what an awful face.

00:11:30.744 --> 00:11:33.044
No luck at all.

00:11:33.044 --> 00:11:37.654
Master Umehara says that if I track
the bond tied between the rabbit and me,

00:11:37.654 --> 00:11:41.424
I can easily catch him, but...

00:11:41.424 --> 00:11:45.224
Master may look like that,
but he's the top warrior monk.

00:11:45.224 --> 00:11:48.194
So he would never steer you wrong.

00:11:48.194 --> 00:11:53.064
What do you mean by,
"he may look like that" Takamasa?

00:11:53.064 --> 00:11:55.934
I mean you look like that, Master.

00:11:58.174 --> 00:12:00.344
Someone dropped these.

00:12:00.344 --> 00:12:03.544
I wonder who dropped them!
How shameful.

00:12:03.544 --> 00:12:06.444
In Mt. Goryo, a place that
even monkeys don't visit?

00:12:06.444 --> 00:12:11.614
Ahh... What a hopeless adult...
He reminds me of someone...

00:12:11.614 --> 00:12:14.354
Now, try again.

00:12:14.354 --> 00:12:16.424
What's a bond?

00:12:16.424 --> 00:12:19.724
A connection that ties a person to another.

00:12:19.724 --> 00:12:22.254
Is it like... fate?

00:12:25.094 --> 00:12:30.474
Yeah. Fate, a connection divined by
the stars, can also indeed be called a bond.

00:12:30.474 --> 00:12:35.304
But even if it's not fate,
a bond can be created.

00:12:35.304 --> 00:12:36.704
Put your hands out.

00:12:40.544 --> 00:12:43.484
A bond has been created
between you and him.

00:12:43.484 --> 00:12:44.474
What?

00:12:48.154 --> 00:12:51.954
All you have to do now is to
find the light that the bond shows.

00:12:51.954 --> 00:12:53.394
Now, go.

00:12:54.264 --> 00:12:56.964
But I don't see anything.

00:12:56.964 --> 00:12:58.724
Just go.

00:13:04.674 --> 00:13:07.174
I wonder if it's difficult after all...

00:13:07.174 --> 00:13:09.574
when he's like that
after spending six months.

00:13:09.574 --> 00:13:14.314
Light is something hard to
see unless you seek it out.

00:13:14.314 --> 00:13:20.024
That boy has been so blessed that
he never had to seek out the light.

00:13:20.024 --> 00:13:21.984
That's all.

00:13:36.034 --> 00:13:38.094
No!

00:13:45.314 --> 00:13:46.344
This is...

00:13:46.344 --> 00:13:47.504
Oh!

00:13:49.014 --> 00:13:51.044
Ah, I'm sorry!

00:13:52.984 --> 00:13:58.394
I thought Japanese boys are all shut-ins
and were interested only in 2-D stuff,

00:13:58.394 --> 00:14:01.364
but you're aggressive and perverted.

00:14:01.364 --> 00:14:02.824
Perverted?

00:14:02.824 --> 00:14:05.334
But, too bad for you.

00:14:05.334 --> 00:14:09.904
Since I'm only interested in
2-D stuff, too. Look at these!

00:14:09.904 --> 00:14:14.534
I knew the bookstores in the
city would have lots of cool stuff.

00:14:16.344 --> 00:14:18.374
Those are so awesome!

00:14:18.374 --> 00:14:23.654
Yes! It's exciting! These're the
moe-moe dojinshi, "Zenbunose Puchi-tto"

00:14:23.654 --> 00:14:25.754
Summer Festival limited
editions, you know!

00:14:25.754 --> 00:14:28.654
Don't "you know" me, half-naked girl!

00:14:28.654 --> 00:14:32.694
I'm not half-naked!
My name is Flesh, Mr. Plum!

00:14:32.694 --> 00:14:32.754
If you don't like "half-naked;'
then I'll call you meat! Meat!

00:14:32.754 --> 00:14:35.094
"Zenbu-nose Puchi-tto"
If you don't like "half-naked;'
then I'll call you meat! Meat!

00:14:35.094 --> 00:14:38.164
"Zenbu-nose Puchi-tto"
I gave you money to buy the zenbu-nose
figure Kinki version limited edition!

00:14:38.164 --> 00:14:39.434
"Zenbu-nose Puchi-tto"
And yet you bought such filthy things!

00:14:39.434 --> 00:14:41.734
And yet you bought such filthy things!

00:14:41.734 --> 00:14:45.334
Official products are ruined by commercialism!

00:14:45.334 --> 00:14:48.604
Real fans love dojinshi magazines instead!

00:14:48.604 --> 00:14:52.374
Ahhh! How filthy!
How filthy! I'll confiscate them!

00:14:52.374 --> 00:14:56.014
No! These're my special friends for tonight!

00:14:56.014 --> 00:14:57.684
Special friends...

00:14:57.684 --> 00:15:00.924
Seriously, I shouldn't have contracted
with someone who became a Shikabane

00:15:00.924 --> 00:15:05.514
after dying in a plane
accident on her way to Akihabara...

00:15:07.094 --> 00:15:10.464
If you're mean to me, I'll tell Touma-san!

00:15:10.464 --> 00:15:15.294
Touma?! Wait. Please.
Anything but that... Okay?

00:15:16.974 --> 00:15:18.434
Touma?

00:15:19.704 --> 00:15:22.774
She's Master Umehara's Shikabane Hime,

00:15:22.774 --> 00:15:25.544
though she's taking a little break right now.

00:15:25.544 --> 00:15:27.544
Is she a scary person?

00:15:27.544 --> 00:15:31.214
"Scary" may not be the
right word... Well, I guess...

00:15:31.214 --> 00:15:35.484
Can a contracted monk
contract with two Shikabane Hime?

00:15:35.484 --> 00:15:40.294
Contracting with two means
he gives twice as much Rune.

00:15:40.294 --> 00:15:42.594
Normally, the monk's body can't handle it.

00:15:42.594 --> 00:15:47.584
But Master can do it... which probably
means that he trains himself that much.

00:15:48.964 --> 00:15:54.634
In my case, I have only Hoshimura-san,
but my Rune was just absorbed forcibly.

00:16:02.314 --> 00:16:04.814
That's because of the curse.

00:16:04.814 --> 00:16:08.284
How is Hoshimura-san doing?

00:16:08.284 --> 00:16:13.324
If something happens to her, you should
feel it since you're her contracted monk.

00:16:13.324 --> 00:16:17.494
But I can't even see the bond with a rabbit.

00:16:17.494 --> 00:16:21.334
As I suspected, Ouri-kun
cares about Makina-chan...

00:16:27.344 --> 00:16:27.994
"Shock!"

00:16:33.374 --> 00:16:35.044
No!

00:16:41.854 --> 00:16:45.824
Master, Itsuki is my Shikabane Hime.

00:16:45.824 --> 00:16:47.494
I'll tell Touma-san.

00:16:47.494 --> 00:16:51.234
I... I came here to tell you
guys something important...

00:16:51.234 --> 00:16:53.534
There goes another silly excuse...

00:16:53.534 --> 00:16:56.804
It's true. It's about Miss Makina.

00:16:56.804 --> 00:16:58.004
What?!

00:16:58.004 --> 00:16:59.474
Hoshimura-san?!

00:16:59.474 --> 00:17:03.004
You going there may
not make any difference.

00:17:03.004 --> 00:17:05.504
Even so, would you like to go, young man?

00:17:07.014 --> 00:17:08.414
Intruder!

00:17:08.414 --> 00:17:09.644
Capture him!

00:17:16.524 --> 00:17:17.824
The traitor monk...

00:17:22.194 --> 00:17:26.394
I'll see you again someday...
in the land of the dead.

00:17:39.344 --> 00:17:40.844
Don't move!

00:17:40.844 --> 00:17:45.914
What're you trying to do by
bringing in that defiled thing?!

00:17:45.914 --> 00:17:50.124
You have something defiled, too, Sadahiro.

00:17:50.124 --> 00:17:52.124
Shikabane can't normally
enter the head temple.

00:17:52.124 --> 00:17:56.294
But by using your zadan,
you can lead them here.

00:17:56.294 --> 00:17:59.894
Looks like it's true that you
joined hands with the Seven Stars.

00:17:59.894 --> 00:18:02.364
Sadahiro, you talk too much!

00:18:02.364 --> 00:18:04.394
Sounds like you know all about it.

00:18:09.474 --> 00:18:10.804
Why?!

00:18:11.114 --> 00:18:12.444
"Why"?

00:18:12.444 --> 00:18:15.314
Hazama of the Seven Stars...

00:18:15.314 --> 00:18:18.044
He's the one who killed
your Shikabane Hime!

00:18:20.654 --> 00:18:24.454
It wasn't Hazama who killed her.

00:18:24.454 --> 00:18:25.824
I did.

00:18:25.824 --> 00:18:27.484
What're you?

00:18:29.664 --> 00:18:33.804
Shikabane Hime...
They're defiled! They're unforgivable!

00:18:33.804 --> 00:18:35.264
You bastard!

00:18:37.834 --> 00:18:39.334
He's after Makina Hoshimura!

00:18:39.334 --> 00:18:40.494
Wha?!

00:18:45.744 --> 00:18:47.914
To think that he became a Shikabane...

00:18:47.914 --> 00:18:51.484
Looks like some of Kougon Sect's
monks are lacking Enlightenment.

00:18:51.484 --> 00:18:56.784
Well then, I shall invite
the Seven Stars now...

00:18:56.784 --> 00:18:58.154
It's here.

00:19:08.964 --> 00:19:11.434
A soldier monk became a Shikabane?

00:19:11.434 --> 00:19:15.674
Shikabane Hime...
Defiled Shikabane Hime!

00:19:15.674 --> 00:19:20.134
I see... So that's your regret...

00:19:23.784 --> 00:19:24.974
You bastard!

00:19:26.154 --> 00:19:27.644
Hoshimura-san!

00:19:28.124 --> 00:19:32.024
Ouri... He's a Kougon Sect's...

00:19:32.024 --> 00:19:35.464
Why would a monk attack Hoshimura-san?!

00:19:35.464 --> 00:19:37.494
Because she's defiled.

00:19:37.494 --> 00:19:40.364
The Kougon Sect is the one
who created them, right?!

00:19:40.364 --> 00:19:44.304
In order to destroy Shikabane!
In order to save people!

00:19:44.304 --> 00:19:49.974
They are defiled! If we stay in contact
with them, we'll become defiled, too!

00:19:49.974 --> 00:19:52.714
I'll never attain Enlightenment!

00:19:52.714 --> 00:19:56.144
I'll never... I'll never become defiled!

00:19:59.754 --> 00:20:03.994
Trying to kill Hoshimura-san
because you don't wanna become defiled...

00:20:03.994 --> 00:20:06.594
You're by far the dirtier one!

00:20:06.594 --> 00:20:11.934
Hoshimura-san! I heard...
that you can't forget about Brother.

00:20:11.934 --> 00:20:15.704
But for now, take my Rune or whatever!

00:20:15.704 --> 00:20:17.694
Otherwise you'll die, right?!

00:20:19.834 --> 00:20:22.174
I'm already dead!

00:20:27.514 --> 00:20:28.844
Don't come!

00:20:28.844 --> 00:20:31.514
The Shiryou will attack you. Stop it!

00:20:33.114 --> 00:20:35.114
This is...

00:20:36.754 --> 00:20:38.584
So this is the bond?

00:20:44.294 --> 00:20:47.284
Ever since that time, you and I have been...

00:20:53.874 --> 00:20:56.374
You couldn't forget someone precious...

00:20:56.374 --> 00:20:58.644
So that turned into regrets...

00:20:59.744 --> 00:21:04.284
If that means being defiled, I'm defiled, too.

00:21:04.284 --> 00:21:06.114
We're the same.

00:21:24.004 --> 00:21:25.404
Hoshimura-san!

00:21:29.344 --> 00:21:30.644
I'm sorry...

00:21:30.644 --> 00:21:31.764
What?

00:21:34.014 --> 00:21:37.414
For not being able to protect Keisei...

00:21:41.024 --> 00:21:46.454
All this time, I've been
wanting to say that to you...

00:21:46.494 --> 00:21:51.494
No matter how harsh a path awaits me

00:21:51.494 --> 00:21:56.204
even if the raging wind blocks my way

00:21:56.204 --> 00:22:00.134
as long as I'm with you...

00:22:05.214 --> 00:22:15.524
People have many encounters
determined by a series of coincidences

00:22:15.524 --> 00:22:26.634
and that's how they will
find their emotional support

00:22:26.634 --> 00:22:30.904
"We'll be okay as long as we're together"

00:22:30.904 --> 00:22:37.144
Just by believing in those words of yours

00:22:37.144 --> 00:22:47.754
I can make it to the world I have yet to know

00:22:47.754 --> 00:22:52.824
No matter how harsh a path awaits me

00:22:52.824 --> 00:22:58.494
even if the raging wind blocks my way

00:22:58.494 --> 00:23:03.504
the changing seasons won't wait for me

00:23:03.504 --> 00:23:08.504
I just press forward, hand-in-hand with you

00:23:08.504 --> 00:23:13.774
Let's go, I'm not scared

00:23:13.774 --> 00:23:18.684
as long as I'm with you...

00:23:26.054 --> 00:23:29.464
Your arms and legs were torn
off and yet you still couldn't die.

00:23:29.464 --> 00:23:33.864
On that day, you cried and begged
for forgiveness in a sea of blood.

00:23:33.864 --> 00:23:36.534
Welcome, "my enemy."

00:23:36.534 --> 00:23:40.094
Now, let's kill each other.
